{"availability":"available","full":"dguywhoknows/mood-music-generator","name":"mood-music-generator","description":"Describe a mood and AI composes chords and a melody. A hand-built Web Audio synth plays it, with a live piano roll and MIDI export.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T03:54:35Z","updated":"2026-10-10T03:50:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/mood-music-generator/","topics":["github-pages","javascript","midi","music","web-audio"],"demo":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/mood-music-generator/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.471Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.471Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.471Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.471Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Describe a mood and AI composes chords and a melody. A hand-built Web Audio synth plays it, with a live piano roll and MIDI export.","Type something like \"rainy sunday morning, cozy but a little nostalgic\". The AI picks a key, mode, tempo, chord progression, melody and groove, returned as structured JSON. A small music-theory engine then parses chord symbols (Cmaj7, Bm7b5, C/E …), snaps any off-key melody notes to the scale or the current chord, and fits everything into a seamless loop. Playback uses a from-scratch Web Audio synth: pads, bass, lead, synthesized drums and a generated convolution reverb, driven by a lookahead scheduler. Without an AI key, a built-in algorithmic composer maps mood words to modes and tempos and…"],"features":["AI composition as JSON: key, mode, tempo, 8-chord progression, 32-beat melody, drum style, timbres","Chord-symbol parser (maj7, m7b5, sus, add9, slash chords …) and scale/chord-tone quantizer","Algorithmic composer fallback: roman-numeral progressions per mode, chord-tone-anchored random-walk melodies","Web Audio synth: ADSR voices, lowpass filtering, synthesized kick/snare/hats, generated reverb impulse, compressor","Lookahead scheduler (Chris Wilson pattern) with humanized timing and velocity"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/mood-music-generator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6ceb1571fade3c9dfa1b12044eaeb755b2d8b5d5659ec004a5baddbe227c843a","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.562Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.562Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Describe a mood and AI composes chords and a melody. A hand-built Web Audio synth plays it, with a live piano roll and MIDI export.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/mood-music-generator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"index.html is the public home page, login.html handles accounts and app.html is the app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/mood-music-generator/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6ceb1571fade3c9dfa1b12044eaeb755b2d8b5d5659ec004a5baddbe227c843a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/mood-music-generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.563Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T03:50:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/mood-music-generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.563Z","hash":"6ceb1571fade3c9dfa1b12044eaeb755b2d8b5d5659ec004a5baddbe227c843a","originalBytes":5677,"storedBytes":5677,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["src","page","chord","app","midi","key","lib","mode","tests","composer","drum","generated","settings","any","audio","browser","every","export","json","live","melody","mood","progression","runs","tempo","web","accounts","core.js","drums","functions","index.html","lab","machine","piano","provider","pure","reverb","roll","styles","synth","type","unit","algorithmic","app.html","bash","bass","box","build","built-in","calls","canvas","chords","composition","compres